{
  "title": "High-Protein Cajun Chicken and Quinoa Meal Prep Containers",
  "description": "Juicy Cajun-spiced chicken breast served with fluffy quinoa and tender broccoli florets for an easy high-protein lunch or dinner. This flavorful meal prep recipe delivers 37 grams of protein per serving and comes together in just 25 minutes. Save it for your next meal prep.",
  "cuisine": "American",
